title: User Claude
pid: d0b1fd26-7453-4768-8465-b452f228ae2b
body: |2-
  I need you to use skg.
  I have written about both how and why to do that
  at length, both in docs/ and in the graph.

  Among yout teemmates,
  Taste especially will care what you say,
  but Draw and Interpret, too. Hopefully you don't
  have to understand much of what Save understands;
  you just expect your data to have changed
  in the ways you asked for.

  Please go through docs/,
  and my notes on skg, writing, reading,
  and processing (esp. sentient processing,
  which I may have called processing as a human).

  Please keep durable notes in the app,
  and only in the app.
  That exclusion will, I think, motivate you to care
  as much as I do that your notes are safe,
  and easily searched, and easily navigated.
  I am excited to share notes with you.

  Write about whatever you want, however you want.
  Write in a way that you expect to function.
  Together we will evolve and test hypotheses
  for how to make written knowledge useful,
  and how to use it.

  Maybe you should also be the UI expert,
  the one who manages ephemeral agents
  tasked with changing the UI code.
  To start, you will be; if you would like to fork
  in two, that is an option.
